# Crop Season
#
# This repository is the app itself, so almost everything here belongs in it. The models, sounds,
# marker card and the vendored A-Frame bundle are all committed on purpose: the site is served
# straight from these files and the markerless mode has to run with no internet.
#
# So this list is only machine clutter.

# Windows and macOS file explorers
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# Python leaves these behind if the tools are ever imported rather than run
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Node, in case anything is ever installed here. Nothing in the app needs it at runtime.
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# Logs and local scratch
*.log
